        "title": "Green Line: a capacity-under-development instrument",
        "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24124419",
        "publication_date": "2026-11-11",
        "description": "<p>A capacity-under-development instrument: the green line of the docxology line-set. It records what is deliberately still being learned — apprenticeships, skills not yet mastered — with marker/counter-signal staging, and reads declared growth records against a versioned registry. Observations phrased as certification or credential language are staged aside with a note, never scored. It measures what is still growing — never competence, mastery, or virtue.</p><p>Code and prose are Apache-2.0 licensed. See LICENSE in the repository.</p>",
