        "notes": "Source metadata for version 0.5.0; a source declaration is not a release or deposit receipt. Previously verified source archive: 0.4.0 / 10.5281/zenodo.24069457, identifying that SOURCE ZIP only, not a standalone manuscript or this source edition. Retained earlier edition: 10.5281/zenodo.22833492; exact version is not established here. Cite later source through its repository until its exact edition/object is independently verified. The existing public automatic integration was authorized on November 8, 2026; future publication requires current owner authority and actual archive verification under docs/publication.md. Main is the colorless reader and Witness remains outside LINE_SET. Copper allocation and Iron recovery are distinct from Green's learner-owned marker coverage."
